      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i dont really have a stiff neck or anything. my vision is okay. i just feel really lightheaded and kind of nauseous. do u think i can just wait this out with some ibuprofen and some sleep? i really dont want to deal with an er visit if it's just a migraine flare up",
