      "content": "While ibuprofen can help manage migraine pain, taking 800mg all at once is a significant dose and should be used cautiously. If you have already taken other medication or are unsure of your dosage limits, it's safer to stick to the recommended maximum dose on the packaging. Prioritize resting in a dark, quiet environment, and if the pain remains severe or worsens after taking the medication, please re-evaluate seeking professional care.",
